\f0\fs24 \cf0 Despite great searching, I have found no dialect contact questionnaire comparable to the BLP or similar.\
I have found a variety of language exposure and identity questionnaires, which I am going to recruit to create our own short dialect contact and identity questionnaire, to get a sense of our participants\'92 exposure to and feelings towards other dialects. This will not be a validated questionnaire, and may give us only crude results, but I think it will be interesting nonetheless.\
\
